      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i can run the checksums. but before i do, i'm thinking about how random it is. it's almost like the error is just... popping in and out of existence. something is definitely messing with the signals on those specific hops. any idea what else could cause such weird, erratic-looking behavior besides just a standard hardware failure?",
